  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "室內設計(三)",
    "sub_ename": "INTERIOR DESIGN (3)",
    "describe_ch": "藉由室內設計的進階課程，使學生對建築空間的場所特質與事件意義有更細膩的認識與運用。本課程的設計將以參與式現場設計施工為課程主軸，並分為團隊創作與個別創作兩階段實施。逐步導入專業的室內設計領域，藉由每週的實際操作訓練與範例討論，將設計理論與工程實務融合為一，並以1:1之作品實體呈現。今日空間觀點與定義、空間的公共與私有、空間的結構與表現形式與使用者、現況調查與測繪方法、室內設計圖說家具創作介紹、材料運用與工法、光環境、視覺傳達運用",
    "describe_eh": "This is a class for advanced studies of Interior Design. By way of workshop training, students will involve in a professional environment and concentrate in construction process as well. There are two main sections for the intensive training.1.Group project: Students will learn to organize several teams to process a competition. During the section, students need to understand the project content as well as to practice the design skills.2. Independent project: Each student will take the first project into a detail development as a 1:1 modeling project. During the period of time, there are professional craftsmen will be introduced into this class in order to process these projects as real.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
